### GET All returns a JSON array.
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItemDtos

### GET One returns the requested record.
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItemDtos/1

### POST creates a record and returns 201
POST http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItemDtos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo using Http Client a POST request",
  "complete": false
}

### PUT modifies an existing record.
PUT http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItemDtos/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 6,
  "name": "Testing version conflict",
  "complete": true,
  "version": 1
}

### DELETE removes a record and returns 204.
DELETE http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItemDtos/7

### Requests for nonexistent records return 404 where appropriate.
#DELETE http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItems/22
GET http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItemDtos/101

### Invalid data produces an appropriate client-error response.
POST http://localhost:8090/restapi/TodoItemDtos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "complete": false
}
